args.doc_text:
RunningHub OpenAPI v2 工作流 API（runninghub.ai）：
- 提交: POST https://www.runninghub.ai/openapi/v2/run/workflow/{workflowId}
  Header: Content-Type: application/json, Authorization: Bearer <KEY>
  Body: {addMetadata: bool, nodeInfoList: [{nodeId, fieldName, fieldValue, description}], instanceType: default|plus|ultra, usePersonalQueue: "false", retainSeconds?: 10-180, webhookUrl?}
  返回: {taskId, status: QUEUED|RUNNING|SUCCESS|FAILED, errorCode, errorMessage, results, promptTips}
- 查询: POST https://www.runninghub.ai/openapi/v2/query  Body: {taskId}  返回同结构；results[].{url(24h有效), nodeId, outputType(png/mp4/txt), text}
- 上传: POST https://www.runninghub.ai/openapi/v2/media/upload/binary  仅 Bearer 头 + multipart file → {code:0, data:{download_url, fileName}}
- 非终态: CREATE/QUEUED/RUNNING/PENDING；终态: SUCCESS/FAILED/CANCEL
- 限制: 需会员；被调工作流须先在网页端手动跑成功一次；results 链接 24 小时过期。
- 文件参数支持公共 URL 或 data:image/...;base64,... 形式。

